---
import type { Locale } from '../i18n';
import { localizePath } from '../i18n';
import '../styles/workflow.css';
interface Props { lang: Locale }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const en = lang === 'en';
const afterCapture = `/images/workflow/read-after${en ? '-en' : ''}.jpg`;
---
<section class="workflow-case" id="workflow-case" aria-labelledby="workflow-case-title">
  <header class="workflow-case-heading">
    <p class="editorial-folio" aria-hidden="true">03</p>
    <h2 id="workflow-case-title">{en ? '“This part needs more detail.”' : '“这一段，写得还不够具体。”'}</h2>
    <p>{en ? 'Follow one small change in our sample article, A clearer product inquiry. The point is simple: you notice what is missing, and your AI does the rewriting.' : '用《写一封信息清楚的产品询价》走一遍。你在阅读中发现问题，把要求说清楚，再让你的 AI 去改。'}</p>
  </header>
  <div class="workflow-proof">
    <article class="workflow-proof-column">
      <p class="workflow-label">{en ? '01 / The original' : '01 / 读到的原句'}</p>
      <blockquote lang="en">Tell the supplier what you need and ask for a quote.</blockquote>
      <p>{en ? 'What exactly should the reader include? The advice stops before it becomes useful.' : '告诉供应商什么？这句话看似没错，却没有帮读者迈出下一步。'}</p>
    </article>
    <article class="workflow-proof-column workflow-feedback">
      <p class="workflow-label">{en ? '02 / Your instruction' : '02 / 你给 AI 的要求'}</p>
      <blockquote>{en ? 'Explain the product, size, quantity, delivery city and date. Use placeholders for unknown facts. Keep both languages consistent.' : '补充产品、规格、数量、收货城市和日期。未知信息用占位符，不要编造；中英文一起改。'}</blockquote>
      <p>{en ? 'Give your usual AI the space instructions and passage, or submit the request as a local Codex task. Check the folder and current article first.' : '把空间说明和原段交给常用 AI，或把要求作为本地 Codex 任务提交。先核对目录和当前文章。'}</p>
    </article>
    <article class="workflow-proof-column">
      <p class="workflow-label">{en ? '03 / The revised passage' : '03 / 改后的段落'}</p>
      <blockquote>{en ? 'Name the product you want, its size and the quantity you need. Include the delivery city and your preferred arrival date so the supplier can quote against a clear request.' : '写明需要的产品、尺寸和数量，并注明收货城市与期望到货日期，让供应商能针对明确的要求报价。'}</blockquote>
      <p>{en ? 'An excerpt from the revised article. Now check that the advice is specific, unknown facts remain placeholders, and the translation agrees.' : '节选自修改后的文章。回来检查：要求是否具体，未知信息是否保留为占位符，译文是否一致。'}</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <figure class="workflow-after">
    <a href={afterCapture} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label={en ? 'Open the complete revised-article screenshot' : '打开完整的修改后文章截图'}><img src={afterCapture} width="1440" height="940" loading="lazy" alt={en ? 'The revised product-inquiry article and its Chinese translation in the actual MD Duck reader.' : '真实 MD Duck 阅读器中，改后的产品询价文章与对应中文译文。'} /></a>
    <figcaption>{en ? 'Back in MD Duck: review the saved revision before marking it as viewed. Actual Mac beta.10 capture; the same file workflow works on Windows.' : '回到 MD Duck，复核保存后的修改，再标为已查看。Mac beta.10 实际截图，Windows 使用相同的文件流程。'}</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="workflow-film" id="workflow-video">
    <div class="workflow-film-copy">
      <p class="workflow-label">{en ? 'A 108-second captioned walkthrough' : '108 秒字幕演示'}</p>
      <h3>{en ? 'Your space. A revision. Your final review.' : '在自己的空间里，把一轮修改看清楚。'}</h3>
      <p>{en ? 'Actual Mac beta.10 captures, arranged into a silent walkthrough: spaces, two ways to work with AI, saved changes and review. The Codex request is entered but not submitted. Publishing is an example handoff; no backend is connected.' : '用真实 Mac beta.10 界面截图编排：空间、两种 AI 用法、保存改动与复核。无声字幕演示中，Codex 要求仅填写未提交；发布为交接示例，未连接后台。'}</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/examples/md-duck-workflow.zip" download>{en ? 'Download the example files' : '下载演示文件，自己试一遍'} <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      <a class="text-link" href={`${localizePath('/guide/', lang)}#ai-workflow`}>{en ? 'Copy the prompts for your own AI' : '复制给你的 AI 的提示词'}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="workflow-film-player">
      <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster={en ? '/images/workflow/video-poster-en.jpg' : '/images/workflow/video-poster.jpg'} width="1920" height="1080" aria-label={en ? 'Captioned MD Duck workflow demonstration' : 'MD Duck 使用流程字幕演示'} data-workflow-video>
        <source src={`/media/md-duck-workflow-${lang}.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
        <track kind="captions" src={`/media/md-duck-workflow-${lang}.vtt`} srclang={en ? 'en' : 'zh'} label={en ? 'English' : '中文'} />
        <p>{en ? 'Your browser cannot play this video.' : '你的浏览器无法播放这个视频。'} <a href={`/media/md-duck-workflow-${lang}.mp4`}>{en ? 'Download the video' : '下载视频'}</a></p>
      </video>
      <p class="workflow-media-links"><a href={`/media/md-duck-workflow-${lang}.txt`}>{en ? 'Full transcript' : '完整文字稿'}</a><a href={`/media/md-duck-workflow-${lang}.mp4`} download>{en ? 'Download video' : '下载视频'}</a></p>
      <details class="workflow-transcript"><summary>{en ? 'Read the text version' : '阅读文字版流程'}</summary><ol>
        <li>{en ? 'Add independent article folders as spaces. A few drafts can stay together; a series can use numbered subfolders. Switch spaces from the top right.' : '把不同文章文件夹添加为空间。散稿直接放一起，系列按序号分子文件夹；从右上角切换空间。'}</li>
        <li>{en ? 'Read the article and identify a specific passage to improve. Copy it, capture it or leave a note.' : '读出哪一段需要改进，复制、截图，或在对应位置留批注。'}</li>
        <li>{en ? 'Use any AI with the copied space instructions, or choose an optional local Codex task after installing and signing in to its CLI. Confirm the folder and article before starting.' : '复制空间说明交给任意 AI；也可安装、登录 Codex CLI 后使用可选的本地任务。开始前确认目录和文章。'}</li>
        <li>{en ? 'Save in the original location. An AI with file access can save it; with a chat-only tool, you save its response. Find the changed article and compare it with the last confirmed version.' : '把修改保存回原处。有文件权限的 AI 可直接保存；只能聊天的工具由你保存。找到有改动的文章，与上次确认的版本对照。'}</li>
        <li>{en ? 'Check facts, wording and translations, then mark the revision as viewed. This updates the comparison baseline; it does not approve publication.' : '核对事实、措辞与译文，再标为已查看。这会更新比较基准，不代表批准发布。'}</li>
        <li>{en ? 'Publish through your own tools or an explicitly authorized AI. Keep the local source, translation, images and hidden review data. Archive completed work and restore it when needed.' : '用自己的工具或明确授权的 AI 发布。保留本地原稿、译文、图片及隐藏审阅数据；完成后归档，需要时恢复。'}</li>
      </ol></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
